地瓜至瓜地马拉拉奥罗拉国际机场与其他主要景点。\n巧克力与可可博物馆 (ChocoMuseo)。\nHotel Casa Santo Domingo博物馆。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q212773","articleTitle":"安地瓜","sourceRevision":91229359,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 安地瓜","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%89%E5%9C%B0%E7%93%9C"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91229359"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q212773"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159118501","name":"索洛拉","country":"GTM","lat":14.773,"lon":-91.183,"kind":"city","region":"GT-SO","rank":10,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159118521","name":"托托尼卡潘","country":"GTM","lat":14.914,"lon":-91.358,"kind":"city","region":"GT-TO","rank":10,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159118531","name":"埃爾普羅格雷索","country":"GTM","lat":14.85,"lon":-90.0167,"kind":"city","region":"GT-PR","rank":10,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159118557","name":"奎拉帕","country":"GTM","lat":14.279,"lon":-90.298,"kind":"city","region":"GT-SR","rank":10,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159118571","name":"奇基穆拉","country":"GTM","lat":14.797,"lon":-89.544,"kind":"city","region":"GT-CQ","rank":10,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159118593","name":"哈拉帕","country":"GTM","lat":14.633,"lon":-89.989,"kind":"city","region":"GT-JA","rank":10,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159118607","name":"薩卡帕","country":"GTM","lat":14.972,"lon":-89.529,"kind":"city","region":"GT-ZA","rank":10,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"薩卡帕 · 地点概要","geo":"萨卡帕是危地马拉的城市，也是萨卡帕省的首府，位于该国东南部，距离首都危地马拉市146公里，始建于1871年11月10日，城市附近有温泉及疗养中心。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q139179","articleTitle":"薩卡帕","sourceRevision":94253977,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribu